<section class="section wrap faq-section" data-analytics-location="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE TALK</p><h2 id="faq-title">A few useful<br /><em>answers.</em></h2></div><div class="faq-list">
  <details data-faq-id="kubernetes_fit"><summary>What if Kubernetes is not right for us?</summary><p>That is a useful outcome. We compare options against your actual constraints and recommend a simpler approach when it fits better.</p></details>
  <details data-faq-id="planning_independence"><summary>Do we have to hire you for implementation?</summary><p>No. Planning is a standalone engagement. Your team keeps the decisions and documentation, whether or not we build together.</p></details>
  <details data-faq-id="pricing_scope"><summary>How much does consulting cost?</summary><p>The fee depends on the question, complexity, people involved, and agreed outputs. We define the price and schedule in a written proposal before starting paid work.</p></details>
